tes to false in a boolean context otherwise."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This conversion can be used in contexts where a bool is expected (e.g. an if condition)."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","note":"The following table shows the value of basic_ios accessors (good(), fail(), etc.) for all possible combinations of ios_base::iostate flags:"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":475,"codeBlockCount":2}
